    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/WONT/modules/fma_module.owl">
        <owl:versionIRI rdf:resource="https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/WONT/modules/2026-10-31/fma_module.owl"/>
        <rdfs:comment>BOT module of the OBO FMA release 2020-04-13 (the FMA OFL 2.0.0 imports) for the layers WONT&apos;s wound depth classes name -- Epidermis, Dermis, Superficial fascia (the subcutis), Investing fascia (the deep fascia), Muscle organ, Bone organ -- and Skin. Extracted 2026-10-31 by scripts/wont_fma_module_and_bridge_2026_10_31.py.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


